# Python 3.14

- `from __future__ import annotations` at top of new modules
- Type hints on all public functions; pydantic models for config/contracts
- structlog for logging (not print/stdlib logging in runtime)
- Line length 100; ruff target py314
- Early returns; explicit exception handling — never bare `except:`

Install: `pip install -e ".[live,dev,test]"`
